uting the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+2{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the fourth derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{(4)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+2{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-6{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{6}{{x}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249964 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249965 13194139533765 true] [17592186249964 1000 #edb/ref 17592186249966 13194139533765 true] [17592186249964 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533765 true] [17592186249964 1041 "field-1" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249964 1104 #edb/ref 17592186249966 13194139533765 true] [17592186249964 1110 #uuid "8cb7ab8c-4aec-566e-8339-637b3fb0343b" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249965 1034 "\\cos(x)+\\frac{6}{x^4}" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249965 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533765 true] [17592186249965 1111 #uuid "35d0af18-5e31-52a4-8fc4-704f25cc3950" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249966 1034 "\\cos(x)-\\frac{6}{x^4}" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249966 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533765 true] [17592186249966 1111 #uuid "1e890c01-50d7-58fb-b218-eaa314e54cb4" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249967 1017 #edb/ref 17592186249968 13194139533765 true] [17592186249967 1089 "q-342966" 13194139533765 true] [17592186249967 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533765